OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fight to save coach
OL,4,Aroutes facing axe
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners, an MP and a university are
OL,7,Ffighting to save two coach routes
OL,8,Fconnecting Kent and London after the
OL,9,Foperator said they would be withdrawn
OL,10,Fnext month.
OL,12,FNational Express said the Dover 007
OL,13,Fservice and Ramsgate 022 service, run
OL,14,Fby its partner The Coach Travel Group,
OL,15,Fwere no longer commercially sustainable
OL,16,Fbecause of declining demand and rising
OL,17,Fcosts driven by escalating fuel prices.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
