OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fight to save coach
OL,4,Aroutes facing axe
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulie Wassmer, who has started a
OL,7,Fpetition, said up to 20 drivers and
OL,8,Fstaff faced redundancy and older people
OL,9,Fand those with mobility issues would
OL,10,Ffind rail travel "impossible".
OL,12,FNational Express said it recognised the
OL,13,Fimportance of the services to local
OL,14,Fcommunities but had to take responsible
OL,15,Fdecisions.
